save_ma_input_annotation
_category.description
;Data items in the MA_INPUT_ANNOTATION category identify input annotation assignments and their states. Annotation data are connected to modeling protocol steps through MA_DATA and MA_DATA_GROUP. These records do not assert that an output model satisfies a condition.
